ES45s have similar specs but our Compaq reps are saying this is referring
to the temperature reported by the sensors in the box (at cpu-boards etc).
eg.

RMC>env

       System Hardware Monitor

Temperature (warnings at 48.00C, power-off at 53.00C)
    CPU0: 28.00C    CPU1: 29.00C    CPU2: 29.00C    CPU3: 29.00C
    Zone0: 27.00C    Zone1: 28.00C    Zone2: 26.00C

bash-2.05# /sbin/sysconfig -q envmon
envmon:
env_current_temp = 29


The room is at 22-23oC.  Some of our nodes are running close to 35oC.



