No worries.  Exercise the benefits of free choice.  This isn't
Microsoft land - you aren't stuck with one vendor or distro.  No
vendor can be all things to all people, nor can they be flawless.  
We're no exception, nor is any other distro.  If you decide that
Debian, or some other distro works out better for you, then that
is what is important - you're still using free software, and
still using Linux.



