On Tue, Jun 11, 2002 at 07:01:31AM -0500, Earl Truss wrote:
>
> Is there a list of machines this will work on?  I've got an AlphaServer
> 2100 5/250 currently running RedHat 7.0 but the RH7.1 install CDs would
