The initrd-2.4.9-32.img should be in /boot.  If it is not there:

1) Boot into rescue mode
2) cdroot /mnt/sysimage
3) mkinitrd /boot/initrd-2.4.9-32.img initrd-2.4.9-32
4) check that /boot/initrd-2.4.9-32.img now exists
5) reboot

Bob




