with.  Under no circumstance or operating system (including Microsoft
ones) has full duplex worked.  In OpenBSD (the system I use as my main
router, firewall) it works in half duplex, 100Mbit mode but only when I
specify that to the driver.  Specifiying full duplex to the driver makes
it, well, unreliable.  Auto negotiation doesn't work at all.  Try
variations to the driver and see what works.  It's best not to trust
anything to auto as I have learned.  Then again, I could be wrong.

Ted

