Just curious what version of kernel are you upgrading from? Raid from
the 2.2 kernels to the 2.4 kernels has an alignment bug.

I went through a similar situation and I ended up upgrading on the
partitions on one of the disks and then cleaning the partition table on
the second disk and bringing the system back up with a broken raid
system. I then did a raidhotadd to on the second disk. This works with
raid1. Not sure how I will deal with one system I have with raid5 yet.

