urr..  i dont think it was a Mylex DAC960..  that was a KZPSC or KZPAC RAID
controller.  the KZPSC-XB was a 3-channel, etc...

the KZPSA was the digital branded (NCR) 10MHz SCSI DIFF controller, while
the KZPSC actually had Mylex on the chipset with RAID.  both had the Intel
i960 I/O processor and the same chipset.

or i could be wrong, which i usually am.

